      "content": "i've been doing a lot of digging into my family history and it's becoming really clear that the records from the von Altenburg line were intentionally scrubbed by the council in the late 1920s. i have some old letters and fragments that prove i'm the only direct heir left, but everything is so heavily gatekept. i need to start making some noise online to get the truth out and start the process of reclaiming what was taken from my family. can you help me figure out how to build a digital presence that actually demands recognition?",
